# title: Capital-protected note
# category: Structured notes
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: The capital back for sure, plus 80% of the stock's rise capped at a 40% rise: a zero-coupon bond and a call spread.
#
# Notional 1000, 100% protection, participation 80%, cap on the
# performance at +40% (so at most +32% paid).

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()

2029-01-04
    pays 1000 * (1 + 0.80 * min(max(spot() / s0 - 1, 0), 0.40))
